# Keep this repository focused on the inputs required to rebuild ranker.
# Already tracked files remain tracked; these rules control new files only.
*
!.gitignore

!ranker_reconstructed_code/
!ranker_reconstructed_code/CMakeLists.txt

!ranker_reconstructed_code/include/
!ranker_reconstructed_code/include/**

!ranker_reconstructed_code/src/
!ranker_reconstructed_code/src/**

!ranker_reconstructed_code/resources/
!ranker_reconstructed_code/resources/main_menu_bink_fallback_565.bin
!ranker_reconstructed_code/resources/main_menu_bink_fallback_anim.z
!ranker_reconstructed_code/resources/ranker_resources.rc
!ranker_reconstructed_code/resources/original/
!ranker_reconstructed_code/resources/original/**

!ranker_reconstructed_code/third_party/
!ranker_reconstructed_code/third_party/zlib113/
!ranker_reconstructed_code/third_party/zlib113/**
